flowchart TD
    A[DISCHARGE Command] --> B[Post Discharge Bed-Day]
    B --> C[Release Bed to Housekeeping]
    C --> D[Calculate Final Bill]
    D --> E[Charges - Discounts - Deposits]
    E --> F[Round Half-Up to Rupee]
    F --> G{Balance Due?}
    G -->|Yes| H[DISCHARGE_PENDING_PAYMENT]
    G -->|No| I{Refund Due?}
    I -->|Yes| J[REFUND_DUE]
    I -->|No| K[SETTLED]
    H --> S[Discharge Blocked - Payment Required]
    J --> T[DISCHARGED - Refund Obligation]
    K --> T
    T --> U[Close Open Demands]
    U --> V[Lift Procedure Block]
    V --> W[HOUSEKEEPING_CLEARED]
    W --> X[Bed Available]
